<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">SpecBlock: Block-Iterative Speculative Decoding 
<br class="ltx_break">with Dynamic Tree Drafting</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
